  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CONSULTANCY AGREEMENT regarding formulation of Development Engagement in North Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the assignment is to assist the Ministry of Foreign Affairs (MFA), Department for Middle East and North Africa (MENA), in developing and formulating a draft programme document for an engagement on North Africa 2022-2024 to be presented initially for the Council for Development Policy and ultimately the Minister for Development Cooperation. The programme will focus on climate and green transition in Morocco, Algeria, Tunisia and Egypt.</narrative>
  </description>
